  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_5797.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La noche de este mi&eacute;rcoles, 8 de octubre, ha sido completita en las fiestas de oto&ntilde;o de Ay&oacute;dar, con intercambio de la banda de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Suera, y emboladas de dos toros de Miguel Parejo, mientras actuaban Los Makis en la plaza.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5774.jpg\" alt=\"img_5774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5775.jpg\" alt=\"img_5775\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5776.jpg\" alt=\"img_5776\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5777.jpg\" alt=\"img_5777\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5778.jpg\" alt=\"img_5778\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5780.jpg\" alt=\"img_5780\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5781.jpg\" alt=\"img_5781\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5784.jpg\" alt=\"img_5784\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodar081014/img_5785.jpg\" alt=\"img_5785\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestas